# Local CI verification evidence.
#
# artifacts/local-ci/latest.json records which commit passed the containerised pipeline, and
# last-run.log is the transcript. Both are per-developer, per-run facts about a machine — not
# repository history — and committing them would put a claim about a verification in the tree
# without the verification. Everything else under artifacts/ is deliberate, reviewed content and is
# tracked.
/artifacts/local-ci/
